      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "eight people",
      "explanation": "A count of eight people, using the Sino-Japanese number {八|はち} with the counter {人|にん}. {八|はち} keeps its full form here — there is no small-tsu change as in {八本|はっぽん} or {八回|はっかい}."
    }
  ],
