  "notes": "{八|はち} plus the counter {人|にん} for people.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {八人|はちにん}で: as a group of eight\n- {八人|はちにん}{乗|の}り: eight-seater (of a vehicle)\n- {八人|はちにん}{家族|かぞく}: a family of eight\n\nRELATED COUNTS:\n- {七人|しちにん}: seven people\n- {十人|じゅうにん}: ten people\n- {何人|なんにん}: how many people",
